            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method implemented by a wireless transmit/receive unit (WTRU), and a corresponding WTRU are disclosed. The WTRU receives a physical uplink control channel, PUCCH, resource configuration, wherein the PUCCH resource configuration indicates one or more PUCCH resource sets, wherein each PUCCH resource set of the one or more PUCCH resource sets comprises one or more PUCCH resources. The WTRU then receives a physical downlink control channel, PDCCH, transmission comprising downlink control information, DCI, wherein the DCI comprises a PUCCH resource indication, where after the WTRU selects a PUCCH resource set from the one or more PUCCH resource sets based on a number of uplink control information, UCI, bits to be transmitted, and selects the PUCCH resource from the one or more PUCCH resources of the selected PUCCH resource set based on the PUCCH resource indication comprised in the DCI. The WTRU then transmits a PUCCH transmission using the selected PUCCH resource, the PUCCH transmission comprising the UCI bits.</p>
            </abstract>
